{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261030/photo/bkn-20261030112902907-1030_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261030121419\"/><p>事主受傷清醒送院。(吳鎮興攝)</p><p>西貢有人意外被困。今晨(30日)10時54分，一名年約60歲男子報案，指自己在蠔涌水口工作期間，腳部意外被困於泥頭車的車底。救援人員接報到場，將受傷清醒的事主救出交由救護車送往將軍澳醫院治理，案件列作「有人意外受傷」處理。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T04:21:32.908316+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T03:29:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T04:18:36.590161+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T04:18:36.590161+00:00","content_hash":"5733c722eecf8a2d49c1434c08da4a154f981a27e5c795adf5c2a8c35f90fec2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}